entityDescription:
(1) The object of the Company is
 - the raising of funds (public and private)and other support for the construction and operation of a commercial space Station;
 - the conception, coordination and implementation of marketing measures to the benefit of such space Station;
 - the sale, marketing and brokering of trips to the space station as weil as capacities and places in the space station;
 - support for the development, project planning, construction and Operation of a commercial space station.
(2) The Company may conduct all business and take all actions that are suitable for serving, directly or indirectly, the purpose of the Company. This also includes acting as a contractor and as a subcontractor.
(3) The Company may acquire other companies of the same or a similar nature and may acquire interests in such companies. The company may establish branches in Germany and abroad.
